{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-23T15:18:51.995Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"b2ed10cbfe9ede2fb711f0a0","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-23T15:18:51.995Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-23T15:18:51.994Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Classification (scheduled-failure triage 2026-11-23, deep run 45008656889): class 1 - a real product failure, host-independent and date/race-dependent. First real failure: deep (22/26, npm/bun) jobs on omarchy all failed 'Full npm release gate'/'Full Bun release gate' in test/verify-release-changelog-sections.test.ts: 'required release version 2026.11.22 has no usable changelog section: committed changelog must have exactly one section for 2026.11.22' (and the entry-point test inherited exit code 1). Timeline: the run was created 09:40Z on main 333a1510 (before the release), jobs started on local runners 18:05Z+ after tag v2026.11.22 (17:27Z) already existed, and checkout fetch-tags: true lists it while the audited snapshot predates the release changelog. Reproduced deterministically with a fixture repo: an older snapshot plus a newer release tag not reachable from it fails the current verifier."}]}],"before_hash":"cd57f4142cade0c2cb196e0e9da9b15afe521704f1f2688cd41f07827c184dcf","after_hash":"f65361d10a22e0c2bbb43f9a8ba06062cf73ad9c619c40a1bf90cf18ae3addfe","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7d34b3cbceaecb638036e8f4a94227cc8d3e507d6c40da5f647dd7bc11ac977a"}
